Natsume Soseki was known for writing works that overflow

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.980
<b>Host
Sakai Masato</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.770
with warmth and excellence such as <i>I Am a Cat</i>  and <i>Botchan</i>.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.150
<b>Property of the Kanagawa
Prefectural Museum of Modern Literature
Natsume Soseki</b>

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.690
Did you know

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:08.980
<b>Natsume Soseki
Property of the Kanagawa
Prefectural Museum of Modern Literature</b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:09.980
that Soseki wrote these works
hoping for a soft change of pace?

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.200
Change of pace
that Soseki wrote these works
hoping for a soft change of pace?

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.030
Soseki was mentally cornered and
troubled by human relations and disease.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.160
A haiku poet, Takahama Kyoshi,

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.750
<b>Kyoshi Memorial Museum
Takahama Kyoshi</b>

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.420
could not ignore that and suggested
he write a novel to change his mood.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:25.500
And thus, his first novel was <i>I Am a Cat</i>.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.710
"I Am a Cat"
And thus, his first novel was <i>I Am a Cat</i>.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:32.630
However, five years later, a serious illness almost killed Soseki.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:36.010
After that, his style focused on the darkness of the human mind

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:36.590
and his works became dark.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:40.470
Darkness of the mind
and his works became dark.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:41.020
Darkness of the mind

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:42.140
For example, this book <i>Kokoro</i>.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.310
The masterpiece of Natsume Soseki's later years, published in 1914
Kokoro

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.270
In this masterpiece of Soseki's later years,
Kokoro

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.270
he portrayed the difficulties of moral values and egoism.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.610
Maybe Soseki's true thoughts are hidden in this work.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.570
True thoughts

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:54.900
The masterpieces are blue.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.410
The
masterpieces
are blue

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:00.030
Please watch the first episode of <i>Kokoro</i>.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:28.350
She was like a bellflower.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:30.230
Kokoro

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:37.200
Summer
Kokoro

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.620
Studying?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.490
Yes.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.660
Am I interrupting?

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:48.000
No, but don't you need to
practice more on the koto?

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.080
I'm not improving at all...

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.550
I'll put the barley tea here, all right?

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:53.960
Thank you.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.470
That book seems difficult.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.140
I don't understand it at all!

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.510
Please study.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.390
If you'd like, I can teach you.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.100
The way you say that, you sound like a teacher.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.030
Tempura? It looks delicious.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.110
There's also conger eel. You like that, right?

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:19.610
Yeah.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:23.950
They were both very kind and loving people.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:30.540
I considered myself, a countryman, extremely lucky to be able to get lodging in this house.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:37.630
Miss, I'm sorry, but could you please
prepare two pieces of nigiri for me later?

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.640
Oh my, but didn't you just eat?

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.430
It's not for me, just...

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.730
Sounds suspicious.
Don't you think so too, Mother?

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:09.910
K!

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.300
I've been looking for you.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.090
I see.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.170
Hey...

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:19.880
I don't need it.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.760
Why not? You're hungry right?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.600
Even so, I don't need it.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:30.810
Are you training again? You're worse than a Buddhist priest in that regard.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:34.980
I cut my ties with the temple at my hometown long ago.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.530
You're the second son. It was inevitable.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.780
Do you still hold a grudge over being adopted into a doctor's family?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:46.330
I don't. For one thing, I've cut my ties with that family as well.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.290
That's because you deceived your adoptive parents.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:54.130
You pretended to study medicine,
but were actually studying theology.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.130
You're a brave man.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.590
I don't mind doing such things to study the Way.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.630
Then you should've just deceived them until you finished.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:08.100
Once they cut your financial aid, you can't continue studying.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:12.350
I decided that I'm not going to depend on people anymore.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.650
Hey K, won't you come to the place I'm lodging at?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.610
I refuse.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:22.820
Listen, I'm not saying this for your sake, but for my own.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:23.900
What?

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:28.660
Won't you let me study that Way of yours as well?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.040
You...

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.500
Show me your lifestyle up close.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.630
I'm begging you.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.560
Please, let him stay here.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.520
Even if you put it like that, I'm against it.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:00.070
K no longer has anyone to depend on but me.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.490
I don't mind if he lives in the same room as me.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:05.950
I'll pay for all his meals up front immediately.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:08.950
But still...

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.660
Don't worry about your daughter.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:16.620
He strives to broaden his knowledge daily to find his own Way

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.710
and probably won't even give her a second look.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.800
I'm not saying this for my own sake, but for yours.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.680
After my parents died, my relatives betrayed me.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.010
I was lonely.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:34.680
While I was, you and your daughter made me remember human warmth again.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:35.980
Yes...

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:40.520
I want to share your kindness with K as well.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.280
I want to save him from his current coldness.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.070
If you put it like that...

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.780
Thank you very much.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.990
I don't really understand,
but please get a hold of yourself.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.120
I'm home.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:01.340
This is K, the man who I told you about the other day.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.840
Pleased to meet you.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.380
I hope you all get along well.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:10.930
Me too.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.270
Hey...

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.400
Can't you be more friendly?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.650
Why?

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.570
We'll all be living together from now on.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.490
Wouldn't it be more enjoyable if we all got along?

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.210
I have no intention of making it enjoyable.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.960
This is my room.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.130
There's a small anteroom here.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.470
You can either use my room or stay here.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.470
Here is fine.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.470
It's small.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.470
I don't mind.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:57.730
I see.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:58.850
Excuse me.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:00.230
Yes?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.860
Ehm... This.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.570
Thank you very much.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.830
Oh my, studying already?

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:23.080
That room is small, but it's connected to the yard, right Teacher?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.790
Teacher?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.630
Yeah, she calls me that as a joke.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:34.010
It's no joke, you're always
reading books. Just like a teacher.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.390
Thank you.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.470
Shall we eat dinner?

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.060
Yes!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:45.190
We went out of our way tonight. Please enjoy.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:50.690
Are you always speaking with those women?

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.780
Yeah, they're both nice people.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.490
What's so fun about that?

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:02.460
It's a waste of time. It doesn't seem
like they're trying to learn anything.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:06.380
That's because men and women learn different things.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.290
Same thing.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:11.050
Those who don't want to improve themselves mentally are fools.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.880
You haven't changed.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:27.440
For some reason, at that moment, my heart was rumbling.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.500
I'm home.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:50.670
Madam?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.590
Are you here?

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.410
Did something happen?

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.410
It was nothing.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.210
I doubted my eyes.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.830
It couldn't be that K...

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.630
But I felt ashamed quickly.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.420
There was no way K would do something like that.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.180
Oh is that so?

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.810
Yes, I went through a lot of trouble.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.450
He really hated losing.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.120
He must've been a wonderful person.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:06.040
That's not true, he was extremely stubborn.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.880
Could you mend my hakama?

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:17.760
Yes.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.600
I'm home.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:34.690
Hey!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.860
What are you doing?

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.740
I was just asking her to fix it.

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:54.340
You...

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.220
Where were you?!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.220
Where have you been?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.980
I'm sorry. The usual fish salesman didn't show up.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.230
Fish salesman?

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.060
Don't get so worked up.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.320
I'm not.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.570
I see. Well then.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:22.990
Anyway, please don't leave your daughter alone in this house.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:25.780
What do you mean?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.450
It's been unsafe here lately...

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.670
I see... Unsafe.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.340
Let's be careful.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.660
Sorry about this.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.330
Never mind...

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.760
You're quite late.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.600
Miss, about just now...

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.560
Why didn't you talk to us?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:15.810
Miss?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:19.520
I was so scared.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.100
You've been going home early lately.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.600
Classes are boring.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:10.950
Aren't you trying to get some alone time with her?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.330
What are you trying to say?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.410
I'll speak my mind today.

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:18.420
K, you've been disgraceful lately.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.340
What happened to that training you held so dear?

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.500
Weren't you going to complete your Way?

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.220
I understand now.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:28.720
What?

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.930
You called me to that house for her sake, right?

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:33.930
What do you mean?

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:39.900
If she mingled with someone like me, her worth as a human would rise.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.110
She could also brag to other women.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.020
No!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.900
I was thinking of you and...

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.360
Thinking of me?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.450
Are you saying that you, the spoiled brat who gets confused by everything,

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:53.410
mercifully reached out to me?

00:14:55.040 --> 00:15:00.460
Did you think she wouldn't show interest in someone like me?

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.330
This isn't about her!

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.800
Your pride is most important to you, huh?

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.880
You're pathetic.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:14.180
I'm sorry, but I have no interest in rich people's philanthropy games.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.810
What?

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.310
I'm in love with her.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.750
Here, a boxed lunch.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.370
Thank you very much.

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.130
Have a safe trip.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.550
Madam, did he say anything?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.010
What? Did something happen?

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:55.680
No.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.900
Can we talk for a bit?

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:11.570
I'm studying.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:14.490
Please, just come.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.540
About yesterday...

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.380
Yeah?

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:26.840
Were you serious?

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.550
I'm always serious.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:33.180
K, I can't explain this to Madam.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.680
If I knew this was going to happen, I never would've invited you over.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:42.060
I'm sorry about that, but love and obligations are different things.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:48.440
Madam is obviously against you dating.
She won't stand for it.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.440
Then we'll elope or something.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.950
How does she feel?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.450
The same as me, of course.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.030
This is absurd.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.790
I know, but it's unstoppable.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.660
Cut the crap, she'd never be with someone so undetermined.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.050
Determination?

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:19.800
You should know better than anyone that determination is all I have.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.140
Unlike you.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.070
What should I do?

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.080
I'm coming in.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.960
Do you feel ill?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.210
Here's some porridge.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.090
Thank you.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.420
So, what's going on?

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:59.220
K asked for my daughter's hand this morning.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.600
Pardon me.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:08.940
But what am I to do if my daughter marries that good-for-nothing man?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.360
I'm sorry.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.980
You ought to get yourself together.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.740
You like her, right?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.490
It's obvious when I look at you.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.280
I'm sorry.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.490
It's nothing to apologize about.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:25.040
I would gladly give my daughter to you.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.120
Madam,

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.920
please give her to me.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.710
Please give her to me immediately.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.800
Very well, I will give her to you.

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:46.180
But please do not tell K yet.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:47.430
Why is that?

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.140
I swear that I'll tell him myself.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:50.100
I swear.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:51.940
But...

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:52.940
I'm going to school.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.690
Shouldn't you sleep some more?

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.700
Aren't you sick?

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:05.950
Yes.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.790
Shouldn't you go to a doctor?

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:11.080
You can afford it.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.420
I already feel better.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:16.710
Hey.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:20.470
Don't you think this flower is just like her?

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.600
I disagree.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:27.060
I'll plant those seeds next year.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.730
Summer will be over shortly.

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.020
Yeah.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.200
You can't sleep?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.330
Nope.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.880
Same here.

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.420
How about a drink?

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:58.300
With me?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.800
Yes, today is a joyous day.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.970
I would be glad to drink with you.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:14.150
It's all thanks to you.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.320
What are you talking about?

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:21.900
Actually, I've finally found someone for my daughter.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:28.080
Well, they've known about it for a while,

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:32.370
but they're so immature that they never said anything about it.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:37.500
You coming to this house seemingly
made things between them get better.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:42.090
So please bless them.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:50.530
<b>Summer this
year was
beautiful</b>

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:57.540
I've lost to K.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:03.800
Even on the happiest day of my life,
the day I was bound to her,

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:10.050
my body smelled like blood to me.

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:17.770
K will hold me captive for my entire life.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:30.050
Next Time
Kokoro             Winter
